# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

scanner is project
scanner purpose "Step through text by rules passed as values, and change a list in place; a stage0 sample both runs agree on"
scanner target console
scanner version "0.1.0"
scanner language refined 1
scanner standardLibrary 1
scanner allows write console.stdout none
scanner requires none
scanner includesModule scanner
scanner entry scanner.main
